suǒ yǐ kě néng jiù shì wǒ yù dào zhè zhǒng de qíng kuàng
So maybe I encounter these kinds of situations

123
00:04:59,533 --> 00:05:02,833
我觉得不知道应该去怎么做
wǒ jué de bù zhī dào yīng gāi qù zěn me zuò
And I feel unsure about what I should do

124
00:05:02,833 --> 00:05:03,800
因为我已经
yīn wèi wǒ yǐ jīng
Because I’ve already

