Or will you go back to Singapore or the U.S.?

167
00:07:07,100 --> 00:07:09,633
会 就是一直在上海
huì jiù shì yì zhí zài Shàng hǎi
We'll stay — we’re just staying in Shanghai

168
00:07:10,633 --> 00:07:13,033
OK 很好 很好
OK hěn hǎo hěn hǎo
OK, very good, very good

169
