If I’m not teaching English

483
00:19:47,233 --> 00:19:50,000
比如说我去做翻译啊什么的
bǐ rú shuō wǒ qù zuò fān yì a shén me de
For example, if I’m doing translation or something

484
00:19:50,033 --> 00:19:52,233
他们完全不在乎
tā men wán quán bú zài hū
They don’t care at all

485
00:19:53,033 --> 00:19:53,900
完全不在乎
wán quán bú zài hū
Really don’t care

486
00:19:53,966 --> 00:19:56,133
他们听你说中文就说 OK
tā men tīng nǐ shuō zhōng wén jiù shuō OK
Once they hear your Chinese, they’re like “OK”

487
00:19:56,300 --> 00:19:57,733
那给你一个测试啊
nà gěi nǐ yí gè cè shì a
Then they give you a test

488
00:19:58,400 --> 00:20:01,400
对 如果能通过你就上岗了
duì rú guǒ néng tōng guò nǐ jiù shàng gǎng le
Yes, if you can pass it, you get the job

489
00:20:01,766 --> 00:20:05,133
所以你做的是什么样的翻译
suǒ yǐ nǐ zuò de shì shén me yàng de fān yì
So what kind of translation work did you do?

490
00:20:05,733 --> 00:20:06,433
一个工作
yí gè gōng zuò
One of the jobs

491
00:20:06,433 --> 00:20:10,933
就是一个上海政府的一个公益热线
jiù shì yí gè shàng hǎi zhèng fǔ de yí gè gōng yì rè xiàn
Was a public service hotline for the Shanghai government

492
00:20:10,933 --> 00:20:13,400
就是我们是帮外国人
jiù shì wǒ men shì bāng wài guó rén
We were helping foreigners

493
00:20:13,400 --> 00:20:15,600
在电话上做翻译的
zài diàn huà shàng zuò fān yì de
Doing translation over the phone

494
00:20:15,700 --> 00:20:19,333
所以 比如说如果他们跟他们的阿姨啊
suǒ yǐ bǐ rú shuō rú guǒ tā men gēn tā men de ā yí a
So, for example, if they were talking to their housekeeper

495
00:20:19,333 --> 00:20:21,033
司机啊 想沟通
sī jī a xiǎng gōu tōng
Or driver and wanted to communicate

496
00:20:21,033 --> 00:20:22,966
我们就帮他们翻译
wǒ men jiù bāng tā men fān yì
We would help translate for them

497
00:20:23,033 --> 00:20:25,600
然后是四个小时
rán hòu shì sì gè xiǎo shí
And it was for four hours

498
00:20:25,833 --> 00:20:27,000
很方便的
hěn fāng biàn de
Very convenient

499
00:20:27,400 --> 00:20:29,033
OK 明白
OK míng bái
OK, got it

500
00:20:29,966 --> 00:20:33,733
你觉得 你觉得中国人会歧视外国人吗
nǐ jué de nǐ jué de zhōng guó rén huì qí shì wài guó rén ma
Do you think Chinese people discriminate against foreigners?

501
00:20:33,733 --> 00:20:34,900
尤其是黑人
yóu qí shì hēi rén
Especially Black people?

502
00:20:35,200 --> 00:20:36,366
可能吧
kě néng ba
Maybe

503
00:20:36,933 --> 00:20:41,333
但是我遇到的这情况是非常少
dàn shì wǒ yù dào de zhè qíng kuàng shì fēi cháng shǎo
But in my experience, that kind of situation is very rare

504
00:20:41,333 --> 00:20:42,400
估计没有
gū jì méi yǒu
Probably none at all

505
00:20:42,700 --> 00:20:45,133
但是我觉得应该会嘛
dàn shì wǒ jué de yīng gāi huì ma
But I think it probably does exist

506
00:20:45,133 --> 00:20:46,000
应该会
yīng gāi huì
It probably does

507
00:20:46,000 --> 00:20:48,533
就是可能 就对
jiù shì kě néng jiù duì
Like, maybe… yeah

508
00:20:48,533 --> 00:20:50,366
可能要从别人听到
kě néng yào cóng bié rén tīng dào
Maybe you’d hear about it from others

509
00:20:50,366 --> 00:20:53,766
比如说可能跟你的白人朋友
bǐ rú shuō kě néng gēn nǐ de bái rén péng yǒu
For example, maybe from your white friends

510
00:20:53,766 --> 00:20:54,966
就跟他们讲
jiù gēn tā men jiǎng
They’ll tell you

511
00:20:55,333 --> 00:20:56,533
他们可能会
tā men kě néng huì
They might

512
00:20:56,533 --> 00:20:58,100
如果他们讲中文的话
rú guǒ tā men jiǎng zhōng wén de huà
If they speak Chinese

513
00:20:58,166 --> 00:20:59,400
他们会告诉 哦
tā men huì gào sù ó
They’ll tell you, “Oh…”

514
00:20:59,566 --> 00:21:02,600
这个司机说 黑人 什么什么什么
zhè gè sī jī shuō hēi rén shén me shén me shén me
“This driver said something something about Black people”

515
00:21:02,600 --> 00:21:04,333
你才会听到
nǐ cái huì tīng dào
That’s when you’d hear about it

516
00:21:04,500 --> 00:21:06,133
但是他们不会对你
dàn shì tā men bú huì duì nǐ
But they won’t say it directly to you

517
00:21:06,133 --> 00:21:09,333
就是面对你说这种话 对
jiù shì miàn duì nǐ shuō zhè zhǒng huà duì
They won’t say these kinds of things to your face, right

518
00:21:09,333 --> 00:21:10,966
啊 对
a duì
Ah, right

519
00:21:11,166 --> 00:21:15,500
我想中国人还需要就是多多地认识外国人
wǒ xiǎng zhōng guó rén hái xū yào jiù shì duō duō de rèn shi wài guó rén
I think Chinese people still need to get to know more foreigners

520
00:21:15,500 --> 00:21:16,533
外国文化
wài guó wén huà
And foreign cultures

521
00:21:17,833 --> 00:21:20,933
尤其是我觉得跟美国的情况不一样
yóu qí shì wǒ jué de gēn měi guó de qíng kuàng bù yí yàng
Especially because I think it’s different from the situation in the U.S.

522
00:21:21,166 --> 00:21:24,800
中国人的可能有些歧视就是因为无知
zhōng guó rén de kě néng yǒu xiē qí shì jiù shì yīn wèi wú zhī
Chinese people may discriminate out of ignorance

523
00:21:25,100 --> 00:21:26,966
就是不知道
jiù shì bù zhī dào
They just don’t know

524
00:21:26,966 --> 00:21:28,833
不认识
bú rèn shi
They haven’t met or seen [those people before]

525
00:21:28,833 --> 00:21:31,033
但是我觉得美国更复杂
dàn shì wǒ jué de měi guó gèng fù zá
But I think America is more complicated

526
00:21:31,300 --> 00:21:32,600
有这么多历史
yǒu zhè me duō lì shǐ
There’s so much history

527
00:21:33,433 --> 00:21:34,100
历史 对
lì shǐ duì
History, yeah

528
00:21:34,100 --> 00:21:36,833
因为跟历史有关系 所以
yīn wèi gēn lì shǐ yǒu guān xì suǒ yǐ
Because it’s related to history, so…

529
00:21:37,033 --> 00:21:38,733
你说你在上海生活
nǐ shuō nǐ zài shàng hǎi shēng huó
You mentioned you live in Shanghai

530
00:21:38,733 --> 00:21:41,600
跟你的老公 跟你的三条狗 对不对
gēn nǐ de lǎo gōng gēn nǐ de sān tiáo gǒu duì bú duì
With your husband and your three dogs, right?

531
00:21:43,033 --> 00:21:46,233
哈哈哈 你每天都去遛狗
hā hā hā nǐ měi tiān dōu qù liù gǒu
Hahaha, do you walk your dogs every day?

532
00:21:46,800 --> 00:21:48,800
现在不怎么去遛狗
xiàn zài bù zěn me qù liù gǒu
I don’t really walk them much now

533
00:21:48,800 --> 00:21:51,433
因为就是我受伤了
yīn wèi jiù shì wǒ shòu shāng le
Because I got injured

534
00:21:51,433 --> 00:21:54,100
所以现在是老公去遛它们的
suǒ yǐ xiàn zài shì lǎo gōng qù liù tā men de
So now my husband walks them

535
00:21:54,100 --> 00:21:56,033
偶尔会陪陪它们
ǒu ěr huì péi péi tā men
I’ll occasionally keep them company

536
00:21:56,200 --> 00:21:58,033
你的狗是什么样的狗
nǐ de gǒu shì shén me yàng de gǒu
What kind of dogs do you have?

537
00:21:58,200 --> 00:21:59,200
一个是
yí gè shì
One is

538
00:21:59,200 --> 00:22:01,300
一个小泰迪
yí gè xiǎo tài dí
A small Teddy (Poodle)

539
00:22:01,300 --> 00:22:02,333
我忘了怎么说
wǒ wàng le zěn me shuō
I forgot how to say it

540
00:22:02,333 --> 00:22:04,400
小泰迪 什么泰迪
xiǎo tài dí shén me tài dí
A little Teddy… what kind of Teddy?

541
00:22:04,800 --> 00:22:05,633
泰迪犬
tài dí quǎn
Toy poodle

542
00:22:06,400 --> 00:22:07,233
对 泰迪犬
duì tài dí quǎn
Yeah, toy poodle

543
00:22:07,233 --> 00:22:08,033
好像是
hǎo xiàng shì
I think so

544
00:22:08,733 --> 00:22:13,500
然后另外两只是中华田园
rán hòu lìng wài liǎng zhī shì zhōng huá tián yuán
And the other two are Chinese rural dogs

545
00:22:13,700 --> 00:22:16,933
就是 中华田园 就是
jiù shì zhōng huá tián yuán jiù shì
Like, Chinese rural breed — that’s

546
00:22:17,700 --> 00:22:19,400
中华田园也很可爱
zhōng huá tián yuán yě hěn kě ài
Chinese rural dogs are also very cute

547
00:22:19,400 --> 00:22:21,300
而且很聪明 很健康
ér qiě hěn cōng míng hěn jiàn kāng
They’re also very smart and healthy

548
00:22:21,566 --> 00:22:23,900
非常聪明 非常健康
fēi cháng cōng míng fēi cháng jiàn kāng
Extremely smart and extremely healthy

549
00:22:25,633 --> 00:22:27,733
对 对 对 就是 对
duì duì duì jiù shì duì
Yes, yes, exactly

550
00:22:27,733 --> 00:22:30,033
就可能你不需要怎么照顾它们
jiù kě néng nǐ bù xū yào zěn me zhào gù tā men
Maybe you don’t need to take care of them that much

551
00:22:30,233 --> 00:22:31,233
它们也可以
tā men yě kě yǐ
They can manage fine

552
00:22:31,300 --> 00:22:34,000
就很好 嗯 对
jiù hěn hǎo ǹg duì
They’re great, yeah

553
00:22:34,100 --> 00:22:35,533
你养了三只狗啊
nǐ yǎng le sān zhī gǒu a
You’re raising three dogs?

554
00:22:35,533 --> 00:22:37,333
好厉害 在上海的话
hǎo lì hài zài shàng hǎi de huà
That’s impressive — especially in Shanghai

555
00:22:37,633 --> 00:22:39,200
大家你的邻居有没有
dà jiā nǐ de lín jū yǒu méi yǒu
Do your neighbors ever…

556
00:22:39,200 --> 00:22:41,166
就是对你很好奇
jiù shì duì nǐ hěn hào qí
Get really curious about you?

557
00:22:41,833 --> 00:22:44,366
我两个狗是残疾狗
wǒ liǎng gè gǒu shì cán jí gǒu
Two of my dogs are disabled

558
00:22:44,366 --> 00:22:46,366
就是一个是少了一条腿
jiù shì yí gè shì shǎo le yì tiáo tuǐ
One is missing a leg

559
00:22:46,400 --> 00:22:49,300
然后另一个是它前面那个爪子
rán hòu lìng yí gè shì tā qián miàn nà gè zhuǎ zi
And the other one’s front paw

560
00:22:49,300 --> 00:22:50,333
一直抬着的
yì zhí tái zhe de
Is always lifted up

561
00:22:50,333 --> 00:22:54,366
因为之前的主人是虐待它
yīn wèi zhī qián de zhǔ rén shì nüè dài tā
Because its previous owner abused it

562
00:22:54,433 --> 00:22:55,233
虐待它
nüè dài tā
Abused it

563
00:22:55,333 --> 00:22:58,700
嗯 所以对
ǹg suǒ yǐ duì
Yeah, so…

564
00:22:58,700 --> 00:22:59,633
所以他们就说
suǒ yǐ tā men jiù shuō
So they said

565
00:22:59,633 --> 00:23:01,300
哇 你们好棒
wā nǐ men hǎo bàng
“Wow, you’re amazing”

566
00:23:01,300 --> 00:23:02,366
你们很善良
nǐ men hěn shàn liáng
“You’re so kind”

567
00:23:02,366 --> 00:23:04,533
他们每一次都说
tā men měi yí cì dōu shuō
They say it every time

568
00:23:04,533 --> 00:23:07,566
我们住这里那么长时间
wǒ men zhù zhè lǐ nà me cháng shí jiān
We’ve lived here for such a long time

569
00:23:07,633 --> 00:23:10,033
他们每一次会向我们说
tā men měi yí cì huì xiàng wǒ men shuō
And every time they’ll say to us

570
00:23:10,033 --> 00:23:12,833
你们就给我点个赞
nǐ men jiù gěi wǒ diǎn gè zàn
“You deserve a thumbs-up from me”

571
00:23:13,166 --> 00:23:13,966
点赞
diǎn zàn
Thumbs up

572
00:23:14,700 --> 00:23:15,566
对 点赞
duì diǎn zàn
Yes, thumbs up

573
00:23:15,966 --> 00:23:17,033
明白
míng bái
Got it

574
00:23:17,333 --> 00:23:19,166
那我要问你最后一个问题
nà wǒ yào wèn nǐ zuì hòu yí gè wèn tí
Then I want to ask you one last question

575
00:23:19,333 --> 00:23:22,300
因为我们是教中文的
yīn wèi wǒ men shì jiāo zhōng wén de
Because we teach Chinese

576
00:23:22,566 --> 00:23:24,633
所以听这个播客的人
suǒ yǐ tīng zhè gè bō kè de rén
So the people listening to this podcast

577
00:23:24,766 --> 00:23:26,600
很多都是在学中文
hěn duō dōu shì zài xué zhōng wén
Most of them are learning Chinese

578
00:23:26,933 --> 00:23:30,233
他们可能很想说一口流利的中文
tā men kě néng hěn xiǎng shuō yì kǒu liú lì de zhōng wén
They probably really want to speak fluent Chinese

579
00:23:30,233 --> 00:23:32,100
他们听到你的中文我相信
tā men tīng dào nǐ de zhōng wén wǒ xiāng xìn
I believe when they hear your Chinese

580
00:23:32,100 --> 00:23:33,200
然后他们觉得
rán hòu tā men jué de
They’ll think

581
00:23:33,200 --> 00:23:35,400
这个女孩说得很好
zhè gè nǚ hái shuō de hěn hǎo
“This girl speaks really well”

582
00:23:35,733 --> 00:23:37,733
你有没有
nǐ yǒu méi yǒu
Do you have any

583
00:23:37,733 --> 00:23:38,633
我想想
wǒ xiǎng xiǎng
Let me think

584
00:23:38,700 --> 00:23:42,833
我觉得大部分的人是觉得中文很难
wǒ jué de dà bù fèn de rén shì jué de zhōng wén hěn nán
I think most people feel Chinese is very hard

585
00:23:43,766 --> 00:23:45,733
或者有时候没有动力呀
huò zhě yǒu shí hòu méi yǒu dòng lì ya
Or sometimes they lack motivation

586
00:23:45,733 --> 00:23:47,166
或者遇到一些困难
huò zhě yù dào yì xiē kùn nán
Or they face some difficulties

587
00:23:47,500 --> 00:23:49,900
你有没有什么建议
nǐ yǒu méi yǒu shén me jiàn yì
Do you have any advice?

588
00:23:50,333 --> 00:23:52,433
建议的话就是多说
jiàn yì de huà jiù shì duō shuō
My advice would be: speak more

589
00:23:52,766 --> 00:23:55,566
还有就是不怕说错
hái yǒu jiù shì bú pà shuō cuò
And don’t be afraid to make mistakes

590
00:23:56,133 --> 00:23:58,800
因为我一开始就是这个问题
yīn wèi wǒ yì kāi shǐ jiù shì zhè gè wèn tí
Because that was my problem at the beginning

591
00:23:58,800 --> 00:24:01,500
就是真的不愿意开口说话
jiù shì zhēn de bú yuàn yì kāi kǒu shuō huà
I really didn’t want to open my mouth to speak

592
00:24:01,500 --> 00:24:03,333
会告诉很多人
huì gào sù hěn duō rén
I would tell many people

593
00:24:03,333 --> 00:24:06,200
就说我很害羞啊 什么
jiù shuō wǒ hěn hài xiū a shén me
I’d say, “I’m shy” and so on

594
00:24:06,233 --> 00:24:08,633
然后就让他们
rán hòu jiù ràng tā men
So they would

595
00:24:08,633 --> 00:24:11,733
不会向我问那么多问题什么的
bú huì xiàng wǒ wèn nà me duō wèn tí shén me de
Avoid asking me too many questions and stuff

596
00:24:11,733 --> 00:24:12,933
就一直听
jiù yì zhí tīng
I would just keep listening

597
00:24:13,733 --> 00:24:15,833
我觉得这个说错
wǒ jué de zhè gè shuō cuò
I think making mistakes when speaking

598
00:24:15,833 --> 00:24:19,433
对你的进步是很有帮助的
duì nǐ de jìn bù shì hěn yǒu bāng zhù de
Is very helpful for your progress

599
00:24:19,500 --> 00:24:22,000
因为我在中国这么长时间
yīn wèi wǒ zài zhōng guó zhè me cháng shí jiān
Because I’ve been in China for such a long time

600
00:24:22,000 --> 00:24:24,566
但是还是有很长很长时间
dàn shì hái shì yǒu hěn cháng hěn cháng shí jiān
But there were still many long periods of time

601
00:24:24,566 --> 00:24:27,633
我讲中文讲得比较少
wǒ jiǎng zhōng wén jiǎng de bǐ jiào shǎo
When I didn’t speak much Chinese

602
00:24:27,633 --> 00:24:28,933
没有很多机会
méi yǒu hěn duō jī huì
There weren’t many opportunities

603
00:24:28,933 --> 00:24:30,800
如果就是遇到这个机会
rú guǒ jiù shì yù dào zhè gè jī huì
If I happened to get an opportunity

604
00:24:30,800 --> 00:24:33,200
我还是有点犹豫 就不想说
wǒ hái shì yǒu diǎn yóu yù jiù bù xiǎng shuō
I was still hesitant and didn’t want to speak

605
00:24:33,200 --> 00:24:35,400
比如说参加什么活动啊
bǐ rú shuō cān jiā shén me huó dòng a
For example, attending an event

606
00:24:35,400 --> 00:24:37,400
我看 啊 全是中国人
wǒ kàn a quán shì zhōng guó rén
And I saw, “Ah, everyone’s Chinese”

607
00:24:37,400 --> 00:24:38,633
然后要讲中文
rán hòu yào jiǎng zhōng wén
And I’d have to speak Chinese

608
00:24:38,633 --> 00:24:41,500
我觉得如果我不知道怎么说
wǒ jué de rú guǒ wǒ bù zhī dào zěn me shuō
I felt like if I didn’t know how to say something

609
00:24:41,766 --> 00:24:44,433
或者可能就是说错了什么
huò zhě kě néng jiù shì shuō cuò le shén me
Or if I might say something wrong

610
00:24:44,433 --> 00:24:46,033
可能就太尴尬了
